#: ../../reference/formats.rst:28
msgid ""
"Each reader and renderer is its own crate, and ``guidedoc-defaults`` "
"registers them. Three crates read: ``guidedoc-rst`` (reStructuredText), "
"``guidedoc-commonmark`` (CommonMark 0.31.2 and MyST), and "
"``guidedoc-sphinx`` (the Sphinx directives, roles and domains on both). "
"Three crates render: ``guidedoc-html``, ``guidedoc-typst``, and "
"``guidedoc-text``. A program can register only the ones it needs; see "
":doc:`../howto/install`."
msgstr ""
"Cada lector y cada renderizador es un crate propio, y "
"``guidedoc-defaults`` los registra. Tres crates leen: ``guidedoc-rst`` "
"(reStructuredText), ``guidedoc-commonmark`` (CommonMark 0.31.2 y MyST) y "
"``guidedoc-sphinx`` (las directivas, roles y dominios de Sphinx sobre "
"ambos). Tres crates renderizan: ``guidedoc-html``, ``guidedoc-typst`` y "
"``guidedoc-text``. Un programa puede registrar solo los que necesita; "
"véase :doc:`../howto/install`."

