#~ "``--untrusted`` disables native build plugins. In Guidedog 0.6.2, "
#~ "build plugins provide source transformations, HTML post-processing, "
#~ "and generated assets. See :doc:`../plugins` for the complete tutorial "
#~ "and architecture."
